    "title": "Support Needed to Keep Cozad Community Center Thriving - NewsBreak",
    "text": "cozadlocal.com\nwebsite\nCozad\nSupport Needed to Keep Cozad Community Center Thriving\nBy Tamie Thurn,\n8 hours agoThe Cozad Grand Generation Center has long been a vital hub for the local residents, offering a wide range of services and activities for people of all ages. But as many of our longtime members are transitioning to retirement homes or sadly passing on, the Center is facing challenges in maintaining the same level of activity and support it once did. With rising food costs, increasing wages, and the misconception that the Center is funded by the City of Cozad, it’s become increasingly difficult to keep everything running smoothly without more community involvement.",
